// where it stays. Before that the arrow is on the ctor's Static, white at 100.
// All of these are R,G,B: a Kd colour key is stored B,G,R,A, the order fng.c
// reads an SA tag in, so the file's bytes read (138,244,204) -- the mint this
// port drew until the retail capture of MC_List (same script, same bytes)
// showed the lime.
#define EATRAX_TEXT_HIGHLIGHT_RGBA C2D_Color32(204, 244, 138, 255)
